forecast.applicantEligibilityDesc:
The Public Diplomacy Section encourages applications from Italy and the United States:

&bull;	Registered U.S. and Italian not-for-profit organizations, including think tanks and civil society/non-governmental organizations with programming experience in Italy;
&bull;	U.S. or Italian individuals;
&bull;	U.S. and Italian non-profit or governmental educational institutions;
&bull;	U.S. and Italian Governmental institutions.
